                    'Rating Tracker: the hyperparameters were chosen by next-season prediction on three season pairs, and the criterion is flat near its minimum (several settings within 0.01 of each other); the choice is one defensible point, not the only one. The with-hindsight kind uses later seasons and must not be read as what could have been known. Its year-to-year stability is partly built in. A player with a BPM row but no tracked stint that season gets no BPM measurement that season.',
